---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — VIP Trains"
  description="How VIP Trains handles your personal data."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
  <p class="page-lede">Last updated: 4 August 2026</p>

  <div class="privacy">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      VIP Trains is a free live departure board for UK trains, run as a small
      independent project. This notice explains what happens to your personal
      data when you use the site. If you have questions, please use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact form:</strong> the name, email address, and message you
        choose to send.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Rate limiting:</strong> your IP address is kept briefly in the
        memory of our data proxy (for about 10 minutes) to stop the contact
        form being flooded. It is not stored or logged.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Theme preference:</strong> stored only in your own browser
        (localStorage) and never sent to us.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not use cookies, analytics, tracking, or advertising.</p>

    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To read and reply to your message.</li>
      <li>To keep the contact form working (spam protection).</li>
      <li>To remember your chosen colour theme on your device.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      Under UK GDPR we process contact-form data with your consent (you choose
      to send it), and rate-limiting IP data under the legitimate interest of
      keeping the site secure.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Resend and Google (Gmail):</strong> to deliver your message to
        our inbox.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Google Fonts:</strong> your browser loads fonts from Google,
        which sees your IP address.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Cloudflare:</strong> edge infrastructure for the live data
        proxy.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>We never sell your data and never use it for marketing.</p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Messages stay in our inbox until we delete them.</li>
      <li>Rate-limiting IPs are forgotten after about 10 minutes.</li>
      <li>
        The theme preference stays on your device until you clear it.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under UK GDPR you have the right to access, correct, erase, restrict, or
      object to the processing of your data, and to data portability. To
      exercise any of these, use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>. You
      may also complain to the Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ICO).
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not aimed at children under 13.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If anything here changes, this page will be updated and the date above
      revised.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
